  "bodyHash": "ByhDdM+8/vc=",
  "content": "<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>(適用於 Fabric)</em></h3><p>FTB Ultimine 提供了有效率的模式，讓你能一次採集多個方塊。只需按住 Minecraft 控制選單中設定的指定按鍵即可啟用模組，收集到的物品會直接掉落在你的腳下，你完全不需要四處走動！在 1.15 及以上版本中，模組會在被挖掘的方塊周圍渲染白色線條，不僅清楚標示你的挖掘區域，看起來也十分美觀！</p><p>在我們的文檔網站上了解更多關於 FTB Ultimine 的資訊：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p><h4><strong>支援與需求</strong></h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com//assets/a1/mods/supports-fabric@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>搭配使用</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><strong>高效方塊採集</strong>：按住可設定的波浪/頓號鍵，一次採集多個方塊，簡化你的挖掘流程。</li>\n<li><strong>增強視覺效果（1.15+）</strong>：在待挖掘、採集或鋤地的方塊周圍顯示白色線條，讓你清楚了解正在進行的操作，再也不用擔心誤挖！</li>\n<li><strong>對草地使用鋤頭</strong>：將功能延伸至農耕，對草地使用鋤頭可一次犁多個方塊，節省時間與精力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物採集</strong>：透過右鍵點擊作物即可輕鬆採集，方便快捷地獲取資源。</li>\n<li><strong>草地特殊處理</strong>：針對草地有專屬處理方式，能有效管理超出標準1格範圍的草地類方塊。</li>\n<li><strong>挖掘輔助</strong>：使用 Ultimine 還能輕鬆挖掘隧道，無論是向上的階梯、向下的通道，還是通往礦井的道路都暢行無阻！</li>\n</ul><p>FTB Ultimine 旨在優化你的挖掘與農耕活動，提供順暢且高效的遊戲體驗。它已內建於我們的許多整合包及其他整合包中！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你也可以用類似的方式對草地使用鋤頭，一次犁多個方塊：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>並且透過右鍵點擊作物來採集：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>草地有特殊處理，會尋找超過1格範圍外的方塊：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>支援</h2><ul>\n<li>關於<strong>整合包</strong>的問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>關於<strong>模組</strong>的問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>只是有疑問？歡迎加入我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>保持最新資訊</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
